{{- /* if and .is.personal (not .is.ephemeral) (not .is.headless) */ -}}
{{- $yaml := fromYaml (output "chezmoi" "execute-template" (include ".chezmoigit.yaml" | trim)) -}}

{{- range $wsName := keys $yaml.workspaces | sortAlpha -}}
  {{- $ws := index $yaml.workspaces $wsName -}}
  {{- $root := default "" $ws.root -}}
  {{- $wsProvider := default "git@github.com" $ws.provider -}}

  {{- range $r := $ws.repos -}}
    {{- /* repo canonical: owner/name[.git] */ -}}
    {{- $repoName := $r.name -}}
    {{- /* se não houver path, usa basename do repo */ -}}
    {{- $basename := (index (splitList "/" $repoName) 1) | trimSuffix ".git" -}}
    {{- $repoPath := default $basename $r.path -}}
    {{- /* provider por repo (se algum dia existir) > provider do workspace */ -}}
    {{- $provider := default $wsProvider $r.provider -}}

{{ printf "[%q]" (joinPath $root $repoPath) }}
type = "git-repo"
url  = {{ printf "%s:%s" $provider $repoName | quote }}
{{- if $r.branch }}
branch  = {{ $r.branch | quote }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $r.shallow }}
shallow = true
{{- end }}
{{ printf "\n" }}
  {{- end -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- /* end */ -}}
